### List users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users?page=1&limit=10

### Search users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users?q=Aarav

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/users-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diya Patel",
  "email": "diya@example.com",
  "phone": "9800000002",
  "city": "Surat",
  "role": "user"
}
